From: Nouveau debugging notes
Subject: [DIAGNOSTIC] gallium/nouveau: timestamp VA surface and teardown tracing

Opt-in tracing for VA surface allocation/clears, slow surface-fence waits, and
VP3 decoder/channel teardown. All records use Mesa's monotonic clock and go to
stderr. The instrumentation does not issue GPU commands or alter wait behavior.

Enable with: NOUVEAU_DIAG_VA_SURFACE=1

---
